Also check:
- Hero image preloading logic (lines 393-402): does `setLoadedHeroImages` with `prev.has(nextIdx)` guard correctly prevent unnecessary state updates?
- Stats bar sort (line 857-860): `.sort()` runs on every render

Report findings with line numbers, be concise, and do NOT modify any files.

